              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Accept",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/articles?pageNumber=0&pageSize=200&productId=<string>",
                  "host": [
                    "{{baseUrl}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "v1",
                    "articles"
                  ],
                  "query": [
                    {
                      "description": "Page number",
                      "key": "pageNumber",
                      "value": "0"
                    },
                    {
                      "description": "Number of events per page range[1,500]",
                      "key": "pageSize",
                      "value": "200"
                    },
                    {
                      "description": "Property Group",
                      "key": "productId",
                      "value": "<string>"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "description": "Fetch metadata for Articles from your PX Subscription. The API provides you with the summary of basic information of each article that makes it easy to work with specific data.\n\nExamples:\n\n| URI | Results |\n| ----- | -------- |\n| GET /v1/articles?pageSize=100 | Get first 100 articles. |\n| GET /v1/articles?pageSize=100&pageNumber=1 | Get next 100 articles. |\n| GET /v1/articles?productId=1234LPSWUBFW | Get Articles of product 1234LPSWUBFW. |\n\nImportant: The default pageSize on list calls is 200. The pageSize can be changed by adding a pageSize parameter to the URL (i.e. /v1/articles?pageSize=100) with a max pageSize=500.\n\nTo fetch a particular page, use the pageNumber parameter (zero based)"
              },
